 *   1996-03-22 · 12th 1996-06-18 · 13th 1997-01-06 · 14th 1997-03-18 · 15th
 *   1998-03-17 · 16th 1999-04-07 · 17th 2000-04-04 · 18th 2001-05-21 · 19th
 *   2001-08-21 · 20th 2002-06-05 · 22nd 2002-12-19 · 21st 2003-07-11 · 23rd
 *   2005-02-04 · 24th 2015-03-27 (RJ Daum) · 25th 2024-03-07 (Samuel Wyatt) ·
 *   26th 2026-01-21 · 27th 2026-04-15.
 *   Grassland Estates West, 13 sections: 1st 2003-09-26 (Max W. Richardson) ·
