 *
 *  - HOA (management certificate, Texas registry): Restrictions and Covenants
 *    Doc. 1988-4272; restated covenants Doc. 1988-22458; assessment notice
 *    Doc. 1993-2635; and an ELECTION EXTENDING ANNEXATION RIGHTS, Doc.
 *    1998-5890 — the instrument by which successive sections were pulled into
 *    the same association. Managed by Vision Communities Management Inc.
