 *  - Abell Junior High, 3201 Heritage Blvd, falls inside the plat area;
 *    Bush Elementary, 5001 Preston Dr, sits immediately east of it. Addresses
 *    from the NCES directory; the positions are geometry against the city's
 *    own layers. NOT attendance zones.
 *  - Not in mapped 100-year floodplain; no mapped playa inside the extent.
 *  - Midland County IS on the imported fire ant regulated-areas list.
 *
 * NOT ESTABLISHED — MUST NOT BE STATED:
 *  - GOLF. At the 1 March 2021 Midland P&Z meeting, Midland-Odessa Golf Corp.
 *    sought initial zoning for a 21.91-acre tract in Lot 1, Block 21,
 *    Grassland Estates Section 16, near Homeland Dr and Homestead Blvd, in the
 *    ETJ. We do NOT know what that is or became. Green Tree Country Club is
 *    roughly a MILE north of the plat area's northern edge — NOT adjacent.
 *    NEVER write that Grassland Estates adjoins a golf course.
 *  - Developer name, acreage, lot counts, alleys, curbs, lot dimensions.
